{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One fish. One heist. Flop around nautical environments while collecting and scoring any object you see. Push for higher scores before time runs out, and find rare items and water to keep on thievin\u2019. Take control of a slippery fish with simple and goofy controls. Try to slap fishermen into the sea, crack secret safes, or send an airstrike to your current location. Can you find all the items and fill out the catalogue?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.poster.avif?t=1761190155\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.webm?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.mp4?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FISHIN\u2019 CRITICAL features multiple unique level environments that each offer new interactions and ways to play. With every play you can go for new collectibles, aim for a new highscore, or complete missions. Unlock fish cosmetics to add a whole new style to your flop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.poster.avif?t=1761190155\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.webm?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.mp4?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny fish physics-based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscore chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with unique missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish costumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jazz saxophone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109410?t=1761190155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/895af92b60b02c83f17f47226216ff0f6241cbd4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761190155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/c5c2828c80b9f9a2ff02c58df27ed3ee588b5d79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761190155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/c5c2828c80b9f9a2ff02c58df27ed3ee588b5d79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761190155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One fish. One heist. Flop around nautical environments while collecting and scoring any object you see. Push for higher scores before time runs out, and find rare items and water to keep on thievin\u2019. Take control of a slippery fish with simple and goofy controls. Try to slap fishermen into the sea, crack secret safes, or send an airstrike to your current location. Can you find all the items and fill out the catalogue?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.poster.avif?t=1761190155\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.webm?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/a57ac5b066922831d87c87da72dc4d40.mp4?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FISHIN\u2019 CRITICAL features multiple unique level environments that each offer new interactions and ways to play. With every play you can go for new collectibles, aim for a new highscore, or complete missions. Unlock fish cosmetics to add a whole new style to your flop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.poster.avif?t=1761190155\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.webm?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109410/extras/ca10af06e0124468f977f40aa1cd3b4d.mp4?t=1761190155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny fish physics-based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscore chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels wit